  "guidance": [
    "Use MPPT (not PWM) at this scale \u2014 15-30% more harvest and lets panel string voltage exceed battery voltage.",
    "Size for array_W / battery_V x 1.25 (e.g. ~1 kW at 48 V ~= 21 A -> 30 A; at 12 V ~= 83 A -> needs a big controller).",
    "The stringing ceiling is the controller's max_pv_voc, NOT the battery bus. 72-cell surplus panels are ~40 V Voc each and Voc rises in cold (x~1.15-1.25).",
    "Not needed as a standalone part if the inverter is an all-in-one (MPPT is built in)."
  ],
